sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Job Controller
    participant APIServer as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant MutWebhook as Kueue Mutating Webhook<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant ValWebhook as Kueue Validating Webhook<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant KueueCtrl as kueue-controller-manager<br/>Watch via 6443/TCP
    participant Operator as openshift-kueue-operator<br/>Watch via 6443/TCP
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,Prometheus: Flow 1: Workload Admission

    User->>APIServer: Submit Job / PyTorchJob / RayJob<br/>Auth: User Token / SA Token
    APIServer->>MutWebhook: POST /mutate-*<br/>TLS (cert-manager cert)<br/>Auth: Kubernetes Admission
    MutWebhook-->>APIServer: Mutated resource<br/>(suspend=true, queue labels)
    APIServer->>ValWebhook: POST /validate-*<br/>TLS (cert-manager cert)<br/>Auth: Kubernetes Admission
    ValWebhook-->>APIServer: Validation result
    APIServer-->>User: Resource created

    KueueCtrl->>APIServer: Watch Workloads<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Note over KueueCtrl: Evaluate ClusterQueue quotas,<br/>fair-share, preemption
    KueueCtrl->>APIServer: Admit workload<br/>(unsuspend Job, set admission status)
    APIServer-->>KueueCtrl: Confirmed

    Note over Operator,CertMgr: Flow 2: Operator Reconciliation

    Operator->>APIServer: Watch Kueue CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Operator->>CertMgr: Create/Update Issuer + Certificate CRs<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    CertMgr-->>Operator: Certificates provisioned
    Operator->>APIServer: Apply operand resources<br/>(Deployment, CRDs, RBAC, Webhooks)
    APIServer-->>Operator: Resources applied

    Note over Prometheus,KueueCtrl: Flow 3: Metrics Collection

    Prometheus->>KueueCtrl: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Auth: Bearer token + mTLS
    KueueCtrl-->>Prometheus: Metrics response
